      "id": "claim_f7fabcf8cbed47b7af54379fdb5040f8",
      "statement": "interview-routes.ts is the sole place the interview's vocabulary is mapped to HTTP: undefined-session becomes 404, a no-open-question outcome becomes 409, an unusable body becomes 400, begin becomes 201 with { id, locale }, and a recorded answer becomes 204 — no status code appears in the domain.",
