    {
      "id": "claim_983bd0e75962465f8d8e18e9b4c94445",
      "statement": "The session identifier is minted in the POST /interview route with randomUUID(), not in the domain, because randomness is ambient nondeterminism like the system clock and save is handed an identifier rather than inventing one.",
