      "id": "claim_10ae8284a6274d2d8dc088646c0eae90",
      "statement": "The question stream carries exactly three SSE event types — token {text}, done {question}, error {message} — each data field a single line of JSON, because JSON.stringify escapes a newline so no model chunk can split one SSE frame into two; there is no id field and no reconnection protocol.",
