      "statement": "composition.ts is the single place in chrysalyst that constructs a concrete adapter: createDependenciesFromEnv takes the environment as a parameter, wires the LLM adapter, the transcript-rendering filesystem session store, and a system clock, omits search rather than stubbing it, and reads nothing — no socket, no file, no session directory until a caller saves.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://packages/server/src/composition.ts",
