    {
      "id": "claim_002751d15c1b4553bfd93e21d7c5a9a6",
      "statement": "renderTranscript is passed into the session store config by reference, not wrapped: @chrysalyst/core's renderer and the store config share the StoredSession<InterviewState> signature, so no adapting lambda stands between them, and the store writes a real transcript instead of the metadata stub.",
